{
  "dom_id": "step-e13029",
  "name": "Example: Finding the Inequality Represented by a Number Line",
  "problem": "What inequality corresponds to the red colored graph shown in the number line below?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14148516/assets/399512ad3596d2d055849d631cfbe45859a74de5e5604fb0da55aadc62a421c9.png)",
  "worked_solution": "The red arrow indicates that $x$ should consist of all the values greater than $2.$ In addition, the filled red circle at $2$ implies that $x$ can be equal to $2.$\n\nTherefore, the highlighted region represents the numbers that are greater than or equal to $2.$ This corresponds the inequality $x \\geq 2.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e13029\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Finding the Inequality Represented by a Number Line</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e13029\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>What inequality corresponds to the red colored graph shown in the number line below?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-4ffe900b101eca2cd9d1be2a92f5072a\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/4ffe900b101eca2cd9d1be2a92f5072a\"></div>\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n           